    "Name": "Viper -- Dragonfly",
    "Details": "The Viper is a fast, highly-maneuverable medium OmniMech originally designed by Clan Fire Mandrill and later won by Clan Ghost Bear. The Viper is built on a lightweight Endo Steel chassis and powered by a weight saving 320 XL engine that propels the Viper to a top speed of 129.6 km/h and carries eight jump jets to boot while seven tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor keep it well protected. The Viper has an Anti-Missile System for added defense capabilities and has two Machine Guns for use against soft targets. The Viper's main guns are two Medium Pulse Lasers and an SRM-4 launcher that allow it to harass other 'Mechs and vehicles.",
